{
  "title": "Jubilant Dense Venezuelan Plantain Pilaf",
  "description": "A pungent and energizing Venezuelan dish featuring mirin and plantains, this pilaf is jain-friendly and perfect for a weeknight dinner.",
  "cuisine": "Venezuelan",
