      "amount": "1/2 teaspoon"
    },
    {
      "name": "black pepper",
      "amount": "1/4 teaspoon"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Heat the oil in a large saucepan over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is translucent and starting to caramelize.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for an additional minute, stirring constantly to prevent burning.",
    "Add the cumin, paprika, salt, and pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Add the hon dashi and mirin, and bring the mixture to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and add the sliced plantains to the saucepan.",
    "Cover the saucepan with a tight-fitting lid and steam the plantains for 20 minutes, or until they are tender and the liquid has been absorbed.",
    "Fluff the pilaf with a fork and serve hot."
  ],
